% references.bib: the site-wide bibliography
%
% Every post reads this one file: posts/_metadata.yml sets
% `bibliography: ../references.bib`. Each post's References list shows only
% the works that post cites, so a work cited in several posts has one entry
% and is formatted the same way everywhere.
%
% Entries with a "% VERIFIED:" comment were checked on 2026-11-14 against the
% publisher, DOI landing page, Project Euclid, arXiv, a library catalogue, or
% the source itself; the comment says what each was checked against. Entries
% carrying "% UNVERIFIED:" could not be checked against the authoritative
% page; the reason is given. Entries with neither comment have not been
% checked; the section note above them says where they came from.
%
% Pandoc ignores text outside @entries, so these comment lines are safe.

